  "sourceTitle": "hearim(헤아림): Maybe you don’t need a special model for Jev — ordinary local LLMs already have the capability",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2a69a10b627d10d72305863971d3dff7c61852be42c20637a9baedc81ae7ff72",
