  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff5b50ee51f9ae83",
      "translationZh": "如果不需要新模型就能做出类似Jev的决策，会怎样？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40e995859c412597",
      "translationZh": "我构建了 hearim（헤아림，发音为 hea-a-rim，意为 “不是 Here, I am.. lol”），一个开源网关，可将普通的本地或托管的大语言模型（LLMs）转换为兼容 Jev 的决策 API。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b158c55c4fa7847",
      "translationZh": "没有针对特定任务的微调模型。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d07a86048b2b39ae",
      "translationZh": "没有自定义决策模型权重。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72b45d3511a0aaf4",
      "translationZh": "没有生成JSON的解析，并且希望模型遵循该模式。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6f707323a54cff2",
      "translationZh": "仅预填充（使用前缀缓存）+ 仅 1 个 token 解码（使用 logits）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93ad19652f4e2091",
      "translationZh": "这可以消除大部分时间延迟，并且无需生成文本。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c36f5b6be7490aae",
      "translationZh": "基本思想是，预训练语言模型在指令调优或 RLHF 教它如何聊天之前已经学到了很多。如果你只需要它在明确定义的选项之间进行选择，那么这种能力很可能已经存在于其概率分布中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2028af60d2b62a19",
      "translationZh": "模型可能已经知道。我们只需要停止让它写文章。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f52feeceba8247f",
      "translationZh": "hearim 将决策转换为一组受限的替代方案，读取模型对它们的概率，并通过 Jev Choice , Score , and Noul API format 返回结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a30e4efe44239a74",
      "translationZh": "我在一个独立的实现中已经使用这种底层技术超过一年 —之前。 hearim 本身是一个新的、独立的重新实现，专门围绕 Jev API contract 构建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "deaf4b9e6ea84cd3",
      "translationZh": "我不声称它能够复制 Jev 的架构、训练、校准、速度或性能。有趣的主张范围更窄：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a2b2eb4b41f3e88",
      "translationZh": "一个有用的 Jev-style 接口不一定需要一个专门的 Jev-style 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3976975b73f05aea",
      "translationZh": "实现、支持的后端、局限性、基准测试和技术细节如下：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a052c6f26e7cf5f4",
      "translationZh": "论文：https://github.com/ziozzang/hearim/blob/main/paper/paper.pdf",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fe17a2fe6b74c10",
      "translationZh": "我很想看看人们在使用不同的本地模型时会发生什么——尤其是更小的基础模型，而不仅仅是经过指令微调的模型。模型可能已经知道答案。我们只需要停止让它写一篇文章。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a19e601bc7bd9946",
      "translationZh": "提交者：/u/ziozzang0",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    }
  ],
